                                "sense_id": "6ae95829-fe36-38c5-9b75-4f653dc233e6",
                                "text": "The competitors come from as far away as New Zealand and Spain to the Lumberjack Bowl in Hayward--formerly a holding pond for Weyerhauser's North Wisconsin Logging Company--to pole climb, speed saw, logroll, and chop with all their might."
